Eze 33:1 , According to the duty of a watchman in warning the people
Eze 33:7 , Ezekiel is admonished of his duty;
Eze 33:10 , God shews the justice of his ways towards the penitent and towards revolters;
Eze 33:17 , He maintains his justice;
Eze 33:21 , Upon the news of the taking of Jerusalem he prophecies the desolation of the land;
Eze 33:30 , God's judgment upon the mockers of the prophets.
